{"3816080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legendary Tomb digger", "steam_appid": 3816080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about tomb raiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the tomb location and start digging with your tools, collect interesting treasures or other tomb raider's personal items you found in the tomb. Sell or keep them, upgrade your tools and equipments, and dig further into the giant tomb, until you reached one of the tomb's darkest secrets as you go deeper. Many things can go wrong in the process, you choices will decide your destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends whisper of an immortal fairy, 'Snow Lady', beneath the Arctic ice. At the invitation of legendary explorer Bai Jin, you delve into glacial tombs to seek priceless treasures for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by safehouse monitors, you dig deeper, unearthing Bai Jin's personal items carved with bloody pleas for help—yet she insists they were merely lost in an avalanche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live up to your title as the Grave Digging legend... and never fail the woman waiting in the safehouse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, make your choices carefully, for this game have multiple endings, which is determined by your actions and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.poster.avif?t=1766120163\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.webm?t=1766120163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.mp4?t=1766120163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about tomb raiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the tomb location and start digging with your tools, collect interesting treasures or other tomb raider's personal items you found in the tomb. Sell or keep them, upgrade your tools and equipments, and dig further into the giant tomb, until you reached one of the tomb's darkest secrets as you go deeper. Many things can go wrong in the process, you choices will decide your destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends whisper of an immortal fairy, 'Snow Lady', beneath the Arctic ice. At the invitation of legendary explorer Bai Jin, you delve into glacial tombs to seek priceless treasures for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by safehouse monitors, you dig deeper, unearthing Bai Jin's personal items carved with bloody pleas for help—yet she insists they were merely lost in an avalanche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live up to your title as the Grave Digging legend... and never fail the woman waiting in the safehouse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, make your choices carefully, for this game have multiple endings, which is determined by your actions and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.poster.avif?t=1766120163\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.webm?t=1766120163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.mp4?t=1766120163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Legendary Tomb digger is a single player digger adventure game, You will play as a veteran tomb robbery expert, delving into a frozen ancient Arctic tomb. Dig deep to collect treasures from the tomb, sell them to purchase and upgrade tomb-raiding equipments, and search for a priceless secret.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/19f03da9f32e43573cdf0c2d441d79eb51f2788b/header.jpg?t=1766120163", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/4be82054a676473d910da0f2e3eebd39cd0317e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766120163", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816080/4be82054a676473d910da0f2e3eebd39cd0317e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766120163", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.2Ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB Dedicated VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4Ghz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 3 GB Dedicated VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Tide Studio"], "publishers": ["T